+# Session 6, package X: `extra_model_paths.yaml` generator (coder report)
+
+Branch `feat/m0-skeleton`, working copy on top of HEAD `e384d43` plus the verified packages Q, S0, F, G. No git write command was used. All edited files are LF. MSVC toolchain, default `target/`, `-j 6`, `VITEST_MAX_WORKERS=2`.
